{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030150253054-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030171614\"/><p>警員到涉案展覽廳調查。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>中環發生盜竊案。今午(30日)2時31分，一名展覽活動負責人報案，指愛丁堡廣場5號香港大會堂，有雕塑不翼而飛，懷疑被人偷走。警員趕抵展開調查，案件暫列「盜竊」跟進。</p><p>現場所見，有關展覽廳正舉行「微波國際新媒體藝術節 2026」活動。官方網站資料顯示，主題展覽將於10月31至11月8日正式對外開放讓市民參觀。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:45:01.052221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:02:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.984296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:07.638442+00:00","content_hash":"07f89754dfbe9b39a22bfbf585381f159cc68ee4faf37708e68564399d5bbb01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:45:01.052221+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}